    "body": "Oh! I must not be developing as folks expect. I use custom events all the time in components I write, whether it’s a carousel firing a `changeslide` event, or a global menu firing an `openmenu` event. I use `CustomEvent` for all of these things. I don’t use other classes because I am not pretending to be other kinds of event, like `MouseEvent`, `KeyboardEvent`, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat you’re saying about testing code paths seems like a different use case. Is what I’m doing rare / wrong / not best practice?",
