    "updated_at": "2017-07-28T06:01:43Z",
    "body": "FWIW, we do want easy-to-use APIs, but as I mentioned above you lose a lot with the proposed API. It would only be convenient if you're interested in just `CustomEvent`. So it's not easy-to-use-vs-easy-to-implement. Rather it's a tradeoff between flexibility and posing restrictions on consumers. And in that case we do tend to chose to not cut off functionality.",
